}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"According to his biography on the National Institutes of Health (NIH) website, Liu received his Ph.D.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"in Biochemistry from the University of California, Berkeley in 2004.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"[1] This suggests that he spent a significant amount of time at the university, engaging in research and academic pursuits that laid the foundation for his future career as a researcher.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"Further evidence of Liu's attendance at UC Berkeley can be found in his publication record.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"A 2003 paper published in the Journal of Biological Chemistry lists Liu as a graduate student in the Department of Biochemistry and Molecular Biology at the University of California, Berkeley.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"[2] This publication demonstrates Liu's involvement in research projects during his time at the university, which is a key aspect of graduate-level education.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"In addition to these sources, Liu's LinkedIn profile also lists the University of California, Berkeley as his alma mater, providing further evidence of his attendance at the institution.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"[3]\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"References:\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"[1] National Institutes of Health.\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"Allen P.\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"Liu, Ph.D.\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.nih.gov\\\\/about-nih\\\\/who-we-are\\\\/nih-alumni\\\\/allen-p-liu>\"}, {\"id\": \"s23\", \"text\": \"[2] Liu, A.\"}, {\"id\": \"s24\", \"text\": \"P., & Fletcher, R.\"}, {\"id\": \"s25\", \"text\": \"J.\"}, {\"id\": \"s26\", \"text\": \"(2003).\"}, {\"id\": \"s27\", \"text\": \"Nucleotide binding and hydrolysis by the Escherichia coli RNA helicase DbpA.\"}, {\"id\": \"s28\", \"text\": \"Journal of Biological Chemistry, 278(22), 20205-20212.\"}, {\"id\": \"s29\", \"text\": \"doi: 10.1074\\\\/jbc.M212829200\"}, {\"id\": \"s30\", \"text\": \"[3] LinkedIn.\"}, {\"id\": \"s31\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s32\", \"text\": \"Allen P.\"}, {\"id\": \"s33\", \"text\": \"Liu.\"}, {\"id\": \"s34\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.linkedin.com\\\\/in\\\\/allen-liu-545a541\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s35\", \"text\": \"This Wikipedia entry provides comprehensive evidence for the statement \\\"Allen P.\"}, {\"id\": \"s36\", \"text\": \"Liu attended University of California, Berkeley\\\" through a combination of credible sources, including Liu's biography on the NIH website, his publication record, and his LinkedIn profile.\"}]}"
